WEBVTT

00:14:56.291 --> 00:15:01.461
(Applause and cheers)

00:15:01.485 --> 00:15:04.186
Number four: don't wait for instructions.

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:06.593
If you see a problem that needs fixing,

00:15:06.617 --> 00:15:09.600
I think you're the one to do it, OK?

00:15:09.624 --> 00:15:13.695
So start a new organization,
run for office.

00:15:13.719 --> 00:15:18.329
Or maybe it's as simple as standing up
on the job in support of yourself

00:15:18.353 --> 00:15:19.507
or your coworkers.

00:15:19.531 --> 00:15:21.332
This is up to all of us.

00:15:21.654 --> 00:15:26.131
And number five:
invest in women, all right?

00:15:26.155 --> 00:15:27.303
(Applause)

00:15:27.327 --> 00:15:30.975
Invest in women as candidates,
as changemakers, as leaders.